  "description": "DOBQIY crystallizes in the orthorhombic crystal system with space group P n m a. Reported CIF formula moiety: C24 H48 Cl6 Ho6 N48 O6 3+,3(Cl1 1-),0.58(Cl1). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 3 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 3 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 3 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 2 O neighbors; Ho1F (Ho) has 3 O neighbors; Ho3F (Ho) has 3 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 12 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.756-4.203 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 103.97-133.63°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Ho6(μ6-Cl)0.21(μ3-O0.79)4(μ3-OH)2Cl6(μ2-4-NH2-1,2,4-triaz)12][Cl]3.4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 μ3-OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula).",
